              %blockquote
                %p
                  (introduces the claim that the rotation-like operators
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi exp
