            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sergey+M.+Frolov"}> Sergey M. Frolov
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em How do we discover MAJORANA PARTICLES in NANOWIRES?
                %a{:href => "http://portal.if.usp.br/ifusp/"} Instituto de Física, Universidade de São Paulo
                (May 2021) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7btnPqmSh_0"}> video
                \&amp;rbrack;
              %blockquote
                %p
                  %a{:href => "https://youtu.be/7btnPqmSh_0?t=2485"}> 41:25
                  \: No, we have not discovered Majorana particles in nanowires. Yes, we should be able to do it.
            %li#DasSarma22
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sankar+Das+Sarma"}> Sankar Das Sarma
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em In search of Majorana
                %strong 19
                (2023) 165-170 &amp;lbrack;
