                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41567-022-01900-9"} doi:10.1038/s41567-022-01900-9
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li
              Wikipedia,
              %em
                %a{:href => "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Majorana_fermion#Majorana_bound_states"} Majorana bound states
          %p
            The issue of realizing non-
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Clifford+gates"} Clifford
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+gates"} quantum gates
            on Majorana zero modes:
